CK Core CDE for Debian & Ubuntu
===============================

CK Core CDE installs under `/usr/dt` with `RUNPATH=/usr/dt/lib` and links
exclusively against its matched CK Core Motif ABI 9 package (`ck-core-motif9`),
allowing peaceful coexistence with Debian/Ubuntu's system `libxm4` package.

To build the complete matched `.deb` cohort and local APT repository
(`ck-core-motif9`, `ck-core-fs-lib`, `ck-core-cde`, `ck-core-dtlogin`, and
`ck-core-apps`), run `scripts/build-ubuntu-debs.py` from the repository root.
